title RecruitBook Misuse Case Diagram

left to right direction

' ---------- Threat actors ----------
actor AnonymousAttacker
actor InvitationInterceptor
actor MaliciousStudent
actor FakeCounselor
actor PromptInjectionAttacker
actor MaliciousAdmissionsUser

' ---------- System boundary with misuse cases (MC-1 .. MC-6), red-tinted ----------
rectangle "RecruitBookApp Attack Surface" {
  usecase "MC-1: Account Creation Abuse" as MC1 #FEE2E2
  usecase "MC-2: Invitation Link Interception /\nIdentity Substitution" as MC2 #FEE2E2
  usecase "MC-3: Manipulative Profile Submission" as MC3 #FEE2E2
  usecase "MC-4: Malicious / Incorrect\nTranscript Upload" as MC4 #FEE2E2
  usecase "MC-5: AI Prompt Manipulation or\nUnreviewed AI Output" as MC5 #FEE2E2
  usecase "MC-6: Unauthorized Profile Access &\nConsent Bypass" as MC6 #FEE2E2
}

' ---------- Attacker -> misuse case ----------
AnonymousAttacker --> MC1 : attempts
InvitationInterceptor --> MC2 : intercepts
FakeCounselor --> MC2 : attempts
FakeCounselor --> MC4 : uploads
MaliciousStudent --> MC3 : manipulates
PromptInjectionAttacker --> MC5 : manipulates
MaliciousAdmissionsUser --> MC6 : bypasses

' ---------- Security controls as compact notes per misuse case ----------
note right of MC1
Trust boundaries: TB-1, TB-4, TB-6
Controls:
- UserAccount.blockProfilePublishingUntilVerified(): Void
- EmailVerificationToken.validate(): boolean
- EmailVerificationToken.markConsumed(): EmailVerificationToken
- AuditLogEntry.recordSecurityEvent(actor, eventType, target, outcome)
end note

note right of MC2
Trust boundaries: TB-1, TB-4, TB-8
Controls:
- CounselorInvitation.validate(email: string): boolean
- CounselorInvitation.rejectInvalidOrConsumed(email: string): Void
- AccessPolicy.blockUnverifiedCounselor(counselor: CounselorProfile): Void
- VerificationDecision.deny(admin, counselor, reason)
end note

note right of MC3
Trust boundaries: TB-1, TB-2, TB-6
Controls:
- SelfReportedLabel.applyTo(target: object): SelfReportedLabel
- VerificationTier.updateFromSupport(supportType: string): VerificationTier
- StudentProfile.preventSelfVerifiedTranscriptUpload(): Void
- AdmissionsProfileView.showSelfReportedLabels(labels)
end note

note right of MC4
Trust boundaries: TB-3, TB-8
Controls:
- AccessPolicy.requireVerifiedCounselor(counselor: CounselorProfile): Void
- AccessPolicy.requireSameHighSchool(counselor, profile): Void
- FileValidationRule.validate(file: UploadedFile): boolean
- ObjectStorage.storeProtectedFile(file: UploadedFile): string
end note

note right of MC5
Trust boundaries: TB-5, TB-7
Controls:
- AIOutputPolicy.blockUnreviewedOutput(output): Void
- AIOutputPolicy.blockRejectedOutput(output): Void
- AIContextualizationOutput.labelAsAIGenerated(): AIContextualizationOutput
- HumanReviewDecision.approve(reviewer, output, note)
end note

note right of MC6
Trust boundaries: TB-1, TB-2, TB-6, TB-7
Controls:
- AccessPolicy.authorizeAdmissionsProfileView(officer, profile): boolean
- RowLevelSecurityPolicy.enforceProfileAccess(user, profile): boolean
- StudentDiscoverySearch.excludeHiddenProfiles(): Void
- ShortlistEntry.open(officer): AdmissionsProfileView
end note

@enduml
